    "answer": {
      "short": "1:27 a.m. on Wednesday.",
      "worked": "Melbourne is ahead, so add 19 hours.\n\nFrom 6:27 a.m. on Tuesday, adding 17 hours gives 11:27 p.m. on Tuesday. Adding the remaining 2 hours gives 1:27 a.m. on Wednesday.",
